    ["BuffDes_10202167"]="Memakan Doritos - Original, Movement Speed saat tidak dalam status bertarung +1 poin, berlangsung selama 20 menit",
    ["BuffDes_10202182"]="Memakan Engineer 003'S Overtime Night,Max HP, P.ATK , M.ATK, Final P.DEF Effect, Final M.DEF Effect +3%",
    ["BuffDes_10202188"]="Damage terhadap Fire Monster +8%, Damage diterima dari Fire Monster -8%",
