    ["BuffDes_10202196"]="Setelah memakan Roller Coaster Cheese Chips, PVP Final P.DMG Bonus +2.5%, PVP Final M.DMG Bonus +2.5%, Final ASPD +50%, Final Haste +5%, Final P.DMG Bonus +5%, Final M.DMG Bonus +5%.",
    ["BuffDes_10202203"]="Memakan \"You Know Nothing\", Movement Speed saat tidak dalam status bertarung +1, berlangsung selama 20 menit.",
