    ["BuffDes_550060101"]="Dalam status <color=#7ACEFF>Gravitational Storm</color>, penggunaan SP Skill +<color=#7ACEFF>%s%%</color>.",
    ["BuffDes_550060301"]="Dalam status <color=#7ACEFF>Weakening Touch</color>, Max HP -<color=#7ACEFF>60%%</color>.",
    ["BuffDes_550060601"]="Dalam status <color=#7ACEFF>Barbed Armor</color>, Attribute Armor berubah menjadi <color=#7ACEFF>Fire Attribute </color>, setiap kali menerima Damage, akan menyebabkan Damage kepada penyerang.",
