    ["DialogueBubble662491183"]="Selanjutnya, aku akan mulai putarkan telegramnya, perhatikan!",
    ["DialogueBubble662491184"]="5x/6−2= (x +4) /2",
    ["DialogueBubble662491185"]="And you are ṭhe oṄly reasoṄ\n AṄd you are ṭhe only reason",
    ["DialogueBubble662491186"]="K\nN",
    ["DialogueBubble662491187"]="7x +4y=181\n3x-2y=7",
    ["DialogueBubble662491188"]="Selanjutnya, aku akan mulai putarkan telegramnya, perhatikan!",
    ["DialogueBubble662491189"]="W1\nT22\nS11",
    ["DialogueBubble662491190"]="H\nS",
    ["DialogueBubble662491191"]="C\nF",
    ["DialogueBubble662491192"]="SuppÓse it stands tÓ reasÓn\n Thaṭ you would ṭurn on me",
    ["DialogueBubble662491193"]="AX\nXF",
