    ["ItemDes_10204163"]="Buka dan pilih salah satu Card, di dalam termasuk Picky Card, Picky (Shell) Card, Steel Chonchon Card, Pupa Card, Condor Card, Thief Bug Card, Chonchon Card, Male Thief Bug Card, Baby Desert Wolf Card.",
