    ["ItemDes_10204170"]="Buka dan pilih salah satu Card, di dalam termasuk Golem Card, Soldier Skeleton Card, Vitata Card, Phen Card, Marine Sphere Card, Zerom Card, Ant Larva Card, Piere Card, Deniro Card, Mummy Card, Marduk Card, Verit Card",
