    ["ItemDes_10204173"]="Buka dan pilih salah satu Card, di dalam termasuk Obeaune Card, Wormtail Card, Bongun Card, Greatest General Card, Horong Card, Orc Baby Card, Elder Willow Card, Flail-wielding Goblin Card, Mace-wielding Goblin Card, Mace-wielding Kobold Card, Hammer-wielding Goblin Card, Orc Warrior Card",
