    ["ItemDes_10204175"]="Buka dan pilih salah satu Card, di dalam termasuk Sky Petite Card, High Orc Card, Marionette Card, Giant Whisper Card, Bapho Jr. Card, Dagger-wielding Goblin Card, Axe-wielding Kobold Card, Rybio Card, Raydric Card",
