    ["OXExam_Question004"]="Kisah Ragnarok terjadi di <color=#F2C730FF>Another World</color>, benar <color=#64b4ff>(O)</color> atau salah <color=#ff6481>(X)</color>?",
    ["OXExam_Question004_1"]="Terjadi di Midgarts",
